---
// See it in action: the live proof that the wire carries real work.
// Legion is a peer-to-peer LLM -- one model cut into layer-stages, each
// stage running in a browser tab, the stages talking over the Codec wire.
// Inline SVG only (no raster asset) to stay consistent with the site's
// zero-JS, diagram-as-SVG approach. Colors map to the same wire-format
// semantics as the rest of the site: --data (blue) for the model stages,
// --control (green) for the token frame moving between them.
---
<section id="see-it" class="section see">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">see it in action</p>
    <h2 class="see__title">A whole model, running on nobody's data center.</h2>
    <p class="see__lede">
      <a href="https://legion.codecai.net" rel="noopener">Unstable Legion</a> is a
      peer-to-peer language model. One model is cut into contiguous layer
      stages, each stage runs in an ordinary browser tab, and the stages hand
      work to each other over the Codec wire. Only a few kilobytes cross
      between stages per token, so the model does not need to live in one
      place. Open it, chat, and optionally donate your GPU to host a few
      layers. It assembles itself across whoever is online and keeps going as
      peers come and go.
    </p>

    <div class="see__diagram" role="img"
         aria-label="A model split into three stages. Stage one holds the tokenizer and layers 0 to 11, stage two holds layers 12 to 23, stage three holds layers 24 to 35 and the output head. Each stage runs in a separate browser tab, and a token-sized hidden state of about 2 kilobytes flows from each stage to the next over the Codec wire.">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 150" width="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <marker id="see-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
            <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--control)" />
          </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- Stage 1 -->
        <rect x="8" y="40" width="200" height="70" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-elev)" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="108" y="66" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Stage 1</text>
        <text x="108" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg-muted)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11">tokenize + layers 0-11</text>
        <text x="108" y="128" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg-faint)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10">browser tab</text>

        <!-- Stage 2 -->
        <rect x="280" y="40" width="200" height="70" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-elev)" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="380" y="66" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Stage 2</text>
        <text x="380" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg-muted)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11">layers 12-23</text>
        <text x="380" y="128" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg-faint)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10">browser tab</text>

        <!-- Stage 3 -->
        <rect x="552" y="40" width="200" height="70" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-elev)" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="652" y="66" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Stage 3</text>
        <text x="652" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg-muted)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11">layers 24-35 + head</text>
        <text x="652" y="128" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--fg-faint)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10">browser tab</text>

        <!-- Token frame hops -->
        <line x1="210" y1="75" x2="278" y2="75" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#see-arrow)" />
        <text x="244" y="30" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--control)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10">~2 KiB</text>
        <line x1="482" y1="75" x2="550" y2="75" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#see-arrow)" />
        <text x="516" y="30" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--control)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10">~2 KiB</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="see__buttons">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://legion.codecai.net" rel="noopener">Open the live demo</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://themildtake.com/articles/2026-07-17-unstable-legion-p2p-chatgpt/" rel="noopener">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .see__title { max-width: 22ch; }
  .see__lede { max-width: 64ch; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .see__lede a { color: var(--data); border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--border-strong); }
  .see__lede a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--data); }

  .see__diagram {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 0% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--data) 10%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 100% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--control) 8%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg-elev);
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .see__diagram svg { min-width: 520px; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }

  .see__buttons { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.625rem; }
</style>
